    "Trace Direction: forward, reverse or both",
    "Ray Length Mode / Ray Length: custom maximum length, or Endless",
    "Trace Set Attribute: geometry attribute matched against the tracesets layer",
    "Map toggles (Occlusion, Cavity, Curvature, Thickness, Edge, Rounded Normal): each bakes its map when enabled, with its own sample count and settings such as Max Distance, Bias, Radius or Cusp Angle",
